# 💡 Interview Tips

✅ Activity Selection → Sort by End Time.

✅ Fractional Knapsack → Sort by Value/Weight.

✅ Minimum Coins → Largest Coin First.

✅ Assign Cookies → Sort Both Arrays.

---

# ⚠️ Common Mistakes

❌ Sorting by start time in Activity Selection.

❌ Using weight instead of ratio in Knapsack.

❌ Wrong change strategy in Lemonade.

❌ Forgetting to sort arrays.

